{
  "esm": "2.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mount_element_type_reaction_f64_legacy",
    "description": "An esm 2.3.0 root that declares no domain mounts the Float64 reaction-system leaf at a top-level reaction_systems.<k> {ref}. Below esm 2.4.0 an omitted root precision declares Float64, which equals the leaf's, so nothing is written and the document loads."
